# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform.
# Without this, Git for Windows converts text files to CRLF on checkout, which breaks anything that
# hashes or diffs file bytes (the conformance suite's check that the vendored specification is
# byte-identical to upstream failed on every one of its 20 files on a Windows runner).
* text=auto eol=lf

# The vendored TypeDB specification is TypeDB Ltd's, and must stay exactly as upstream has it.
libs/conformance/spec/** -text

# Binary files: never normalised.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
